MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- ⌘T went to New Tab's ActionItem and opened a tab; SidebarHandler's early
  hook now shows the command bar.
- The command bar opens with the four latest tabs, the first picked (Return
  goes back to it), each with Switch to Tab; while typing, the matching tabs
  come above the suggestions.
- Suggestions: what Return opens first, then pages from history, bookmarks
  and open tabs, then at most three searches; picks map back to the
  browser's lines.
- Ask Meridian is a row in the same style.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
